@startuml domain-model-excerpt-us073
title Domain Model Excerpt Relevant to US073 (Create a Flight Route)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam classBorderColor      #5B9BD5
skinparam classFontColor        #1A1A1A
skinparam packageStyle           rectangle
skinparam packageBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam packageBorderColor     #888888
skinparam defaultFontSize        11
hide empty members

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<external>> #EAEDED
    BorderColor<<external>>     #95A5A6
    FontColor<<external>>       #1A1A1A
    BackgroundColor<<new>>      #D5F5E3
    BorderColor<<new>>          #58D68D
}

package "FlightRoute Aggregate" {
    class FlightRoute <<aggregate root>> <<new>> {
        + active : boolean
    }
    class RouteName <<value object>> <<new>> {
        + value : String
    }

    FlightRoute *-- RouteName : identity

    note right of FlightRoute
        - Enforces origin != destination
        - active defaults to true on creation
        - All four constructor args must be non-null
        - Route name prefix must match company IATA code
          (enforced at the application layer)
    end note

    note left of RouteName
        Format: [A-Z]{2}[0-9]{1,4}
        Normalised to upper-case on construction
        System-unique (enforced by controller +
        DB unique constraint)
    end note
}

' External aggregates (not modified by this US)
class AirTransportCompany <<aggregate root>> <<external>>
class Airport <<aggregate root>> <<external>>

FlightRoute --> AirTransportCompany : owned by\n(by CompanyIATACode)
FlightRoute --> Airport : origin\n(by AirportICAOCode)
FlightRoute --> Airport : destination\n(by AirportICAOCode)

@enduml